WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.067
With Force layout enabled, drag a node to fix its position

2
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:11.333
Open View controls on the right

3
00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:15.867
Click Moved to select the fixed node

4
00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:20.667
Click Release to remove the node’s manual fixation

5
00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:26.533
Manual fixation is removed; Moved returns to 0
